  m_Name: NPC_oldman_youDidIt
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPC_DialogueObject
  dialogueText:
  - 'You have the flowers! Excellent!

    In the pot they go to bubble away!'
  - ' And just like that we have a soup ready for tasting!'
  - '*slurp*'
  - Hm. Mhm...
  - '*sluuurp*'
  - Well, I'll be... That's the best soup I ever done made! Good job, sprout!
  - Have yourself a bowl, as promised. And as a thank you, let me teach you the old
    art of the Tounge Grapple!
  - If you shoot out your tongoue towards something, it'll stick to it and you can
    pull yourself closer!
  - Just... be careful. Sometimes that extra movement isn't worth the taste of what
    you'll be sticking to...
